tal Blades launched by Basic Attacks inherit Attack Effects.\nIf bounces from the same Basic Attack or skill hit the same target multiple times, subsequent bounces deal 30% less damage.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_062555a0aac422ba461293262f8092e0.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":6010,"name":"Ninjutsu: Equinox","description":"Passive: Whenever Hanabi has a shield from any source, she is immune to control effects.\nActive: Hanabi gains a 300 (+40% Total Physical Attack) shield for 5s. When the shield is active, she gains 20% Movement Speed and 25% Attack Speed, and 20% of her damage dealt to enemy heroes is added to this shield (only 10% of the damage dealt to non-hero units is added). This shield cannot exceed 50% of her .","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6a2d89d1131e3a9a8f7df3b3fc9503c2.png","video":null,"cd":15.0,"cost":75.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Shield","rgb":"89,168,111"},{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":6020,"name":"Ninjutsu: Soul Scroll","description":"Hanabi fires the energy Kunai in the targeted direction, dealing 350 (+80% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies along the way and reducing their Movement Speed by 60% for 1s. Enemy units hit will also be marked, allowing Hanabi's next Bounce Damage from Basic Attacks to deal 30 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage on them with no damage decay.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9cf15eea1a094676d6b4dafd87bc2adf.png","video":null,"cd":8.0,"cost":50.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"}]},{"id":6030,"name":"Forbidden Jutsu: Higanbana","description":"Hanabi throws Higanbana in the targeted direction, dealing 300 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the first enemy hero hit and immobilizing them for 0.8s. After 1s, Higanbana will bloom at the location of the first hit, dealing 300 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to nearby enemies. Subsequent hits on the same target decay to 30% damage.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_7d52b73b23ce9feabf62c1dd40fce331.png","video":null,"cd":40.0,"cost":120.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"CC","rgb":"205,93,109"},{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Hanabi works well with heroes who can initiate with CC, such as Carmilla and Atlas, so she can focus on maximizing her bounce and Ultimate damage.","heroes":[{"id":92,"name":"Carmilla","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6fb8f120dafdcbc1b5da2a2667016ad5.png"},{"id":93,"name":"Atlas","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d974ac796678180ff8724b88e192898b.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Hanabi counters heroes that rely heavily on CC abilities, such as Tigreal and Belerick, since Hanabi can use her 1st Skill to ignore CC.","heroes":[{"id":6,"name":"Tigreal","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8b30576754be1a4f8bebd09df8d6bec7.png"},{"id":70,"name":"Belerick","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5f2a9eca0bafd4ed8dc39a93c771b3af.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Hanabi is weak against heroes with high burst damage, such as Lancelot and Zilong, because they can quickly take down her shield.","heroes":[{"id":47,"name":"Lancelot","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_dc4b821e49b904715172136017798da3.png"},{"id":16,"name":"Zilong","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9db57da4f0daef6d432676e4f19101ed.png"}]}},"official_url":"https://play.mobilelegends.com/lore/hero/Hanabi","skins":[{"name":"Fiery Moth","name_slug":